OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for direct rail route to
OL,4,ALondon dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rail company has withdrawn its
OL,7,Fapplication to provide a direct train
OL,8,Fservice from Cleethorpes and Grimsby to
OL,9,FLondon.
OL,11,FGrand Central director Chris Brandon
OL,12,Fsaid "the length of time currently
OL,13,Fbeing taken to assess applications
OL,14,Fmeans that our proposal is no longer
OL,15,Fviable".
OL,17,FBrandon said the decision to drop the
OL,18,Fbid came "despite significant local
OL,19,Fsupport".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
