OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for direct rail route to
OL,4,ALondon dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Office of Rail and Road (ORR) said
OL,7,Fthe application "was contested by a
OL,8,Fnumber of other respondents", including
OL,9,FNetwork Rail and the Department for
OL,10,FTransport.
